      <Hint>The network the cabinets are on (usually your LAN, e.g. 192.168.x.x). Automatic lets Windows pick, which can be a VPN or virtual adapter. Each PC's last IP number must be in the Cabinet IP list below.</Hint>
    </FieldInformation>
